# Look up toward the sky (right stick up), then jump and attack in the air, twice (~4 s). Repro for the bright
# flash when jumping and attacking while looking up in the Back Alley (human, 2026-11-11).
200 -
900 - 0 0 0 1      # camera up
150 B   0 0 0 1    # jump
150 A   0 0 0 1    # air attack
150 -   0 0 0 1
150 A   0 0 0 1
600 -   0 0 0 1
150 B   0 0 0 1
150 A   0 0 0 1
150 -   0 0 0 1
150 A   0 0 0 1
600 -
